{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0095","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000039:text","row":20036,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「さて」","en":"“Now, then.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006694","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00001","en":"Taichi: \"So then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000059:text","row":20037,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"ふぁさぁっと前髪を払う。","en":"I sweep my bangs aside with a flourish.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006695","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00002","en":"With a 'fwasah' I sweep my bangs.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000091:text","row":20038,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「邪魔したな」","en":"“Sorry to bother you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006696","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Sorry for the interruption.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:000000dc:text","row":20039,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「おつとめご苦労様です」","en":"“Thank you for your hard work.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006697","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00004","en":"Miki: \"Thank you very much for everything!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000114:text","row":20040,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうだ、美希」","en":"“Oh, right. Miki.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006698","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00005","en":"Taichi: \"Ah, yes, Miki.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:0000013c:text","row":20041,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"立ち止まる。","en":"I stop.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006699","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00006","en":"I stop.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000160:text","row":20042,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"大切なことを伝え忘れていた。","en":"I had forgotten to tell her something important.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006700","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00007","en":"I forgot to tell her something very important.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:0000021a:text","row":20043,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006701","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00008","en":"Miki: \"Yes?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000242:text","row":20044,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「そろそろ部活、活動再開するってさ」","en":"“I hear the club’s about to start up again.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006702","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00009","en":"Taichi: \"I'm hearing that Club is going to be starting up again any time now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000304:text","row":20045,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「部活ですか？」","en":"“The club?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006703","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00010","en":"Miki: \"Club activities, you say?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000334:text","row":20046,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうしても心がきつくなったら、顔を出してみるといい」","en":"“If things ever get too hard, you should drop by.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006704","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00011","en":"Taichi: \"If your heart grows hard no matter what you do, please show face.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","mistranslation"],"assessment":"心がきつくなる means that things become emotionally hard to bear. 'Your heart grows hard' instead suggests becoming callous, while 'show face' calques 顔を出す rather than expressing a visit.","remedy":"Use 'If it ever becomes too much to bear, try dropping by.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":75,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"If your heart grows hard no matter what you do, please show face.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:0000038a:text","row":20047,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「そういうための、部活だろうから」","en":"“That’s probably what the club is there for, after all.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006705","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Because club activities exist just for that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:000003c4:text","row":20048,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"ゆっくりと、美希の顔に理解がさした。","en":"Understanding slowly dawns on Miki’s face.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006706","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00013","en":"Slowly, understanding dawned on Miki's face.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000486:text","row":20049,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「……はい」","en":"“...Yes.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006707","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00014","en":"Miki: \"...yes!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:00000567:text","row":20050,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"喜びだけでないなにかが、そこには混入していた。","en":"There’s something besides happiness mixed in.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:006708","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccb0009:00015","en":"Something that was more than just happiness was mixed in that face.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:000005d5:choice:01","row":20051,"ordinal":16,"kind":"choice","jp":"教室に行く","en":"Go to the classroom","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0095:000005d5:choice:02","row":20052,"ordinal":17,"kind":"choice","jp":"屋上に行く","en":"Go to the roof","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
